```
+--------------------------------------------------+
| SCORE 450  TOPPINGS 2/5  KEY: NO  [1]x1 [2]x0 [3]x1 |  HUD bar (0–44)
|                     00:23.5                      |  escape timer (after pillar)
|                                                  |
