```
World is 3200 px wide: **door (spawn) at far left → maze of platforms, enemies, toppings → key → locked gate at x≈2300 → pillar at far right.**

### Game Over / Victory
- **Victory:** "LEVEL COMPLETE", score + time bonus, big **rank letter (S/A/B/C/D)**, a pose figure that changes by rank, a per-rank music label, "NEW HIGH SCORE!" or current best, then Retry / Main Menu.
- **Game Over:** red title, "Pizzaface got you!", defeated pose, Retry / Main Menu.

